---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-[680px] bg-gradient-to-b from-mint/40 via-cream to-cream"></div>
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-10 px-6 pb-20 pt-16 text-center sm:pt-24">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Logo Meu Ponto" class="h-14 w-14" />
      <div class="text-left">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-teal-dark">Meu Ponto</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft">Arquivo pessoal de comprovantes</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
        Clareza para sua jornada.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-ink-soft sm:text-xl">
        Guarde, organize e reencontre seus comprovantes de ponto com rapidez. Um app nativo, preciso e discreto para manter seu histórico sempre à mão.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android/releases/latest"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-teal px-8 py-3 text-base font-medium text-white shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgba(21,124,112,1)] transition hover:bg-teal-dark"
        >
          Baixar APK mais recente
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M6.5 4L10.5 8L6.5 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-mist px-8 py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-teal/40 hover:bg-white/60"
        >
          Ver código no GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">100% offline • Sem conta • Sem anúncios • Android 8.0+</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
